/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-17.txt\n/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-21.txt\n/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/.dreams/phase-signals.json\n/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/.dreams/daily-ingestion.json\n/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/.dreams/session-ingestion.json\n/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-04-09-minimax-debug.md\n/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-27-0707.md\n/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-25-tiktok-shop.md\n/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-04-15-data-backup.md\n/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-04-16.md\n---\n2026-03-25-tiktok-shop.md\n2026-03-27-0707.md\n2026-04-01-plugin-install-check.md\n2026-04-02-0427.md\n2026-04-02-0532.md\n2026-04-05-1436.md\n2026-04-05.md\n2026-04-08-1138.md\n2026-04-09-minimax-debug.md\n2026-04-09-thinking-card-disable.md\n2026-04-10-0852.md\n2026-04-14-0930.md\n2026-04-15-0917.md\n2026-04-15-data-backup.md\n2026-04-15.md\n2026-04-16.md\n2026-04-17.md\n2026-04-18.md\ndreaming"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777001158193},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clearer picture of the local memory architecture. Let me summarize it for HALEI."},{"type":"text","text":"本地记忆架构是这样的：\n\n**三层结构**\n\n1. **MEMORY.md** — 长期记忆，纯文本，人工维护。存核心配置、用户偏好、系统变更。\n2. **memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md** — 每日日志，记录当天发生的事。持续积累。\n3. **memory/.dreams/** — 向量检索层\n   - `session-corpus/` — 按天分的会话文本语料\n   - `short-term-recall.json` — 短期记忆\n   - `events.jsonl` — 事件日志\n   - `phase-signals.json` — 阶段信号\n\n**检索流程**\n\n- `memory_search` → 走 Gemini 语义搜索，查 MEMORY.md + daily + .dreams\n- `memory_get` → 精确读取某个文件的指定行\n\n**状态**\n\n- 现在运行在 **OpenViking**（4月6日从 OpenClaw 切换）\n- Skills 体系有变化，部分旧 skills 不可用\n- 记忆文件都在，没丢\n\n你说的升级导致记忆丢失——是升级 OpenClaw 版本的时候文件被清了吗？还是别的环节？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTok