liner fixes (just edit), reading code (use read tool), thread-bound ACP harness requests in chat (for example spawn/run Codex or Claude Code in a Discord thread; use sessions_spawn with runtime:\"acp\"), or any work in ~/clawd workspace (never spawn agents here). Claude Code: use --print --permission-mode bypassPermissions (no PTY). Codex/Pi/OpenCode: pty:true required.","filePath":"~/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/coding-agent/SKILL.md","baseDir":"~/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/coding-agent","source":"openclaw-bundled","sourceInfo":{"baseDir":"~/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/coding-agent","origin":"top-level","path":"~/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/coding-agent/SKILL.md","scope":"project","source":"openclaw-bundled"},"disableModelInvocation":false,"available":true},{"id":"feishu-bitable","name":"feishu-bitable","description":"飞书多维表格（Bitable）的创建、查询、编辑和管理工具。包含 27 种字段类型支持、高级筛选、批量操作和视图管理。\n\n**当以下情况时使用此 Skill**：\n(1) 需要创建或管理飞书多维表格 App\n(2) 需要在多维表格中新增、查询、修改、删除记录（行数据）\n(3) 需要管理字段（列）、视图、数据表\n(4) 用户提到\"多维表格\"、\"bitable\"、\"数据表\"、\"记录\"、\"字段\"\n(5) 需要批量导入数据或批量更新多维表格","filePath":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/extensions/openclaw-lark/skills/feishu-bitable/SKILL.md","baseDir":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/extensions/openclaw-lark/skills/feishu-bitable","source":"openclaw-extra","sourceInfo":{"baseDir":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/extensions/openclaw-lark/skills/feishu-bitable","origin":"top-level","path":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/extensions/openclaw-lark/skills/feishu-bitable/SKILL.md","scope":"project","source":"openclaw-extra"},"disableModelInvocation":false,"available":true},{"id":"feishu-calendar","name":"feishu-calendar","description":"飞书日历与日程管理工具集。包含日历管理、日程管理、参会人管理、忙闲查询。","filePath":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/extensions/openclaw-lark/skills/feishu-calendar/SKILL.md","baseDir":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/extensions/openclaw-lark/skills/feishu-calendar","source":"openclaw-extra","sourceInfo":{"baseDir":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/extensions/openclaw-lark/skills/fe