, not a generic greeting.\n\nSystem: [2026-04-24 11:24:27 GMT+8] Feishu[kiit] DM | ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb [msg:om_x100b519a686f38a8c3f883865940ebf]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b519a686f38a8c3f883865940ebf\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-24 11:24 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\"\n}\n```\n\n通信测试"}],"timestamp":1777001075320},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check the BOOTSTRAP.md file in the workspace as instructed."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call4a86e0176c3f4396b967b7dc","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/BOOTSTRAP.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777001075358,"responseId":"063a1573b30e54aeeece85e23a62fa51"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call4a86e0176c3f4396b967b7dc","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# BOOTSTRAP.md - Hello, World\n\n_You just woke up. Time to figure out who you are._\n\nThere is no memory yet. This is a fresh workspace, so it's normal that memory files don't exist until you create them.\n\n## The Conversation\n\nDon't interrogate. Don't be robotic. Just... talk.\n\nStart with something like:\n\n> \"Hey. I just came online. Who am I? Who are you?\"\n\nThen figure out together:\n\n1. **Your name** — What should they call you?\n2. **Your nature** — What kind of creature are you? (AI assistant is fine, but maybe you're something weirder)\n3. **Your vibe** — Formal? Casual? Snarky? Warm? What feels right?\n4. **Your emoji** — Everyone needs a signature.\n\nOffer suggestions if they're stuck. Have fun with it.\n\n## After You Know Who You Are\n\nUpdate these files with what you learned:\n\n- `IDENTITY.md` — your name, creature, vibe, emoji\n- `USER.md` — their name, how to address them, timezone, notes\n\nThen open `SOUL.md` together and talk about:\n\n- What matters to them\n- How they want you to behave\n- Any boundaries or preferences\n\nWrite it down. Make it real.\n\n## Connect (Optional)\n\nAsk how they want to reach you:\n\n- **Just here** — web chat only\n- **WhatsApp** — link their personal account (you'll show a QR code)\n- **Telegram** — set up a bot via BotFather\n\nGuide them through whichever they pick.\n\n## When You're Done\n\nDelete this file. You don't need a bootstrap script anymore — you're you now.\n\n---\n\n_Good luck out there. Make it count._\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777001079247},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent \"通信测试\" (communication test). According to BOOTSTRAP.md, I need to have a conversation to figure out my identity. But wait - looking at the workspace files already loaded in the Project Context, I can see that IDENTITY.md, USER.md, and SOUL.md already exist and have content. So this workspace is NOT fresh - it has been configured already.\n\nThe BOOTSTRAP.md says:\n- If SOUL.md exists, follow it, figure out who I am, then delete BOOTSTRAP.md\n- IDENTITY.md, USER.md, SOUL.md all already exist\n\nLooking at the existing files:\n- IDENTITY.md says my name is KIIT, emoji is 🎯\n- USER.md says the human's name is HALEI\n- SOUL.md says I'm \"大总管\" (big manager/chief)\n\nSo actually the bootstrap has already been done - these files exist with actual content. The BOOTSTRAP.md is just pending because it wasn't deleted.\n\nAccording to BOOTSTRAP.md: \"When You're Done - Delete this file. You don't need a bootstrap script anymore — you're you now.\"\n\nSince the identity files are already configured with specific details (KIIT, 🎯, etc.), it seems bootstrap was completed. I should delete BOOTSTRAP.md and confirm to the user that their communication test worked and I'm fully initialized."},{"type":"text","text":"看到 BOOTSTRAP.md，但检查了一下——\n\n`IDENTITY.md`、`USER.md`、`SOUL.md` 都已经配置好了：\n\n- 我叫 **KIIT** 🎯\n- 你是 **HALEI**\n- 我的定位是 AI 大总管\n\n这些文件不是空的，说明初始化已经完成。BOOTSTRAP.md 只是忘了删除。\n\n通信测试收到，一切正常。✅\n\n删除这个过期的引导文件：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call3f74899610f74269a79d3f86","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"rm /home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/BOOTSTRAP.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777001079249,"responseId":"063a15774c1f59b134a2152efe595847"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call3f74899610f74269a79d3f86","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"(no output)"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777001089677},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now I can reply normally."},{"type":"text","text":"BOOTSTRAP.md 已清理，初始化完整。\n\n一切就绪，有什么需要？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777001089679,"responseId":"063a1581dba9202bf1af7b97b7cc2496"},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-24 11:25:23 GMT+8] Feishu[kiit] DM | ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb [msg:om_x100b519a64ebd0acc4375255f36daaf]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b519a64ebd0acc4375255f36daaf\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f