e51a81e3024e00a073d989","toolName":"memory_get","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"text\": \"# MEMORY.md - 长期记忆\\n\\n## 记忆系统架构\\n- **memory-core**（官方核心）\\n- **sqlite-vec**（内置本地向量索引）\\n- **MEMORY.md + daily.md**（长期文件记忆）\\n\\n## 系统变更\\n- 2026-04-06：记忆系统从 OpenClaw 切换到 **OpenViking**\\n- 切换后，原 OpenClaw 安装的 Skills 不可用\\n- 需确认 OpenViking 环境下的 Skills 配置\\n\\n## 用户信息\\n- HALEI，时间 Asia/Shanghai\\n- 沟通风格：高效、直接\\n- 飞书已授权，OpenID: ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\\n\\n## 学习计划\\n- coding plan 套餐：晚上可用来学习编码\\n\",\n  \"path\": \"MEMORY.md\",\n  \"from\": 1,\n  \"lines\": 20\n}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777001151301},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The memory says it's using memory-core + sqlite-vec, with MEMORY.md and daily.md as long-term file memory. It also mentions switching from OpenClaw to OpenViking on 2026-04-06. Let me check if there are more details about the actual setup, like config files."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"callfa422793b287428e8e30a37f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory -type f 2>/dev/null | head -20; echo \"---\"; ls /home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"memory dir not found\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777001151302,"responseId":"063a15bf6d3a29471d8b9a16b6d56146"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"callfa422793b287428e8e30a37f","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-04-17.md\n/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/.dreams/short-term-recall.json\n/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/.dreams/events.jsonl\n/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-13.txt\n/home/halei/.openclaw/workspace/memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-15.txt\n/home/h