ctories and processes tied to OpenViking—and get explicit confirmation from the user before proceeding with deletion."},{"type":"text","text":"找到了这些东西涉及 OpenViking：\n\n| 路径 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| `~/OpenViking/` | 源代码 (~) |\n| `~/.openviking/` | 配置 + 运行时 |\n| `~/openviking_data/` | 数据目录 |\n\n确认一下：你是想把这三个都删掉，还是只删特定部分？\n\n另外，OpenViking 的记忆系统和 OpenClaw 现有的是**两套独立体系**——删掉 OpenViking 不会影响 OpenClaw 本身的记忆（MEMORY.md + .dreams/ 那些都在）。\n\n要删的话，执行：\n\n```bash\nrm -rf ~/OpenViking ~/openviking_data ~/.openviking\n```\n\n确定？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777001450683,"responseId":"063a16eaedf6628e0ff998112f002b65"},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System (untrusted): [2026-04-24 11:30:44 GMT+8] Exec completed (quiet-cl, code 0) :: lei/OpenViking/bot/scripts/start_vikingbot_in_ecs.sh /home/halei/OpenViking/benchmark/locomo/vikingbot /home/halei/OpenViking/docker/openviking-console-entrypoint.sh /home/halei/O…\n\nAn async command you ran earlier has completed. The result is shown in the system messages above. Handle the result internally. Do not relay it to the user unless explicitly requested.\nCurrent time: Friday, April 24th, 2026 - 11:30 (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-04-24 03:30 UTC"}],"timestamp":1777001460859},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is just the async exec completion notification from the earlier `find` command. No action needed."},{"type":"text","text":"NO_REPLY"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777001460885,"responseId":"063a16f5f49103a690f223ac43f29550"},{"role":"user","content":[{"typ