* — 向量检索层\n   - `session-corpus/` — 按天分的会话文本语料\n   - `short-term-recall.json` — 短期记忆\n   - `events.jsonl` — 事件日志\n   - `phase-signals.json` — 阶段信号\n\n**检索流程**\n\n- `memory_search` → 走 Gemini 语义搜索，查 MEMORY.md + daily + .dreams\n- `memory_get` → 精确读取某个文件的指定行\n\n**状态**\n\n- 现在运行在 **OpenViking**（4月6日从 OpenClaw 切换）\n- Skills 体系有变化，部分旧 skills 不可用\n- 记忆文件都在，没丢\n\n你说的升级导致记忆丢失——是升级 OpenClaw 版本的时候文件被清了吗？还是别的环节？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777001158194,"responseId":"063a15c618d4beb0d2543da5283990f7"},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-24 11:27:11 GMT+8] Feishu[kiit] DM | ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb [msg:om_x100b519a7e21f880c3b06d46a9013ec]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b519a7e21f880c3b06d46a9013ec\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-24 11:27 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\"\n}\n```\n\nopenviking 你不是说不用了吗， 哪些skill用不了了"}],"timestamp":1777001233584},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about which skills are not working. From MEMORY.md, it says \"切换后，原 OpenClaw 安装的 Skills 不可用\". Let me check the current skills available and compare with what might be missing. The available_skills list at the top of my context shows a lot of skills, but the MEMORY.md says some are not usable after switching to OpenViking.\n\nLet me check which skills are actually installed and working."},